Description: The HUPO-PSI mzPeak format is an upcoming, cloud enabled, file
             format for mass spectrometry (MS) data, designed as a successor
             of the current standard open file format mzML. The Spectra
             R package represents the core infrastructure for MS data analysis
             in Biocondcutor. The MzBackendMzPeak package provides data
             backends for mzPeak MS data files adding support for these to the
             Spectra package.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.6.0),
    Spectra (>= 1.15.12)
